00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.335
Hey, Thoughty2 here.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:05.335
What would happen to if the very center

00:00:05.335 --> 00:00:08.015
of your brain was removed?

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.740
That's exactly what a man from Conneticut found out in the 50's.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.140
Henry Gustav Molaison

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:16.925
Widely known as "H.M"

00:00:16.925 --> 00:00:20.145
Is one of neuro-science's most famous cases

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:26.800
He had a bicycle accident at the age of 7, which caused him to have, violent epileptic seizures for the rest of his life.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.300
Until, in 1953 a pioneering neuro-scientist.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.520
Approached him, believing he could cure "H.M's" seizures.

00:00:34.695 --> 00:00:37.655
The daring Doctor was William Beecher Scoville.

00:00:37.655 --> 00:00:40.635
He had a reputation as a daredevil.

00:00:40.635 --> 00:00:43.625
Neuro-scientist, who spent he's whole career.

